<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: BOI shareholders approve Bristol &amp; West buy.</title>
<headline>BOI shareholders approve Bristol &amp; West buy.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Ireland said on Wednesday that its shareholders had passed a resolution in favour of the acquisition of Bristol &amp; West Building Society.  </p>
<p>Bank of Ireland announced on April 15, 1996 that it was buying Britain's Bristol &amp; West in an offer which valued the building society at 600 million stg.</p>
<p>At an extraordinary shareholders meeting on Wednesday, Bank of Ireland shareholders approved a resolution on the proposed transfer of all of Bristol &amp; West's business to Reading Mortgages Plc, which will be renamed Bristol &amp; West Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
